{"kind": "mod", "id": 2749, "name": "TraderGen", "slug": "tradergen", "teaser": "A dependency/framework mod that lets anyone, including non-programmers, create custom traders for SPTarkov using simple JSON files.", "owner_name": "shaneeexd", "downloads": 4308, "favourites": 36, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": true, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.serenity.tradergen", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Traders", "category_id": 16, "updated_at": "2026-08-04T06:02:33.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-06-17T20:03:18.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-06-17T19:53:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "2.3.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<h1>TraderGen - Custom Trader Framework</h1>\n<p><strong>TraderGen</strong> is a server-side framework for SPTarkov that lets anyone create custom traders using simple JSON files, no programming required.</p>\n<h2>What It Does</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Loads trader packs from <code>user/mods/TraderGen/traders/</code></li>\n<li>Registers traders, assort items, loyalty levels, and custom quests automatically</li>\n<li>Supports <strong>story quests</strong> with multiple objectives (kill, handover, survive/extract)</li>\n<li>Handles all image routing and locale registration internally</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Web Tool</h2>\n<p>Create trader packs visually with the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://tradergen-tool.netlify.app\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>TraderGen Tool</strong></a> — fill in forms, upload images, and export a ready-to-use zip.</p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Drag the <code>SPT</code> folder from the mod archive into your SPT installation directory.</li>\n<li>Start the server. TraderGen loads automatically and waits for trader packs.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Making a Trader Pack</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Open the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://tradergen-tool.netlify.app\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">TraderGen Tool</a>.</li>\n<li>Fill in trader details, loyalty levels, items, and optional quests.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Export</strong> to download a zip.</li>\n<li>Drag the <code>SPT</code> folder into your SPT install to test (ALWAYS use a new temporary profile when testing).</li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Do not rename any files or images after exporting.</strong> The mod references them by their generated names (e.g., <code>avatar.jpg</code>, <code>tpl_*.jpg</code>) - renaming will break the pack.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>In-Game Export Feature</h2>\n<p>This allows you to export weapon builds, as well as armour, rig setups, and even containers with items in them and import them into the web app to add to your trader, making the process far easier.</p>\n<p>Read about it <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/ShaneeexD/SPT-TraderGen#export-feature\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here</a>.</p>\n<h2>Publishing a Trader Pack</h2>\n<p>The TraderGen Tool export zip is already structured for distribution — users just drag the <code>SPT</code> folder into their install directory.</p>\n<p>When publishing:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>State the dependencies</strong>: Your add-on requires <code>com.serenity.tradergen</code> v2.0.3+ and <code>com.wtt.commonlib</code> v2.0.20+ (WTT - CommonLib)</li>\n<li><strong>Do not include</strong> the TraderGen/WTT-CommonLib DLL or other authors’ packs in your zip</li>\n<li><strong>Include your assets</strong>: Ensure <code>assets/avatar.jpg</code> and any quest icons are present — <strong>do not rename them</strong>, the mod references them by their generated names</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>SPTarkov 4.0.13</li>\n<li>WTT - CommonLib 2.0.20+</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>More Information</h2>\n<p>View my framework mods and user created add-ons for them <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://serenity-workshop.netlify.app\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here.</a></p>\n<p>See the full documentation, JSON reference, and examples in the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/ShaneeexD/SPT-TraderGen/blob/main/README.md\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GitHub README</a>.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.5.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.13", "content_length": 210606, "downloads": 101, "published_at": "2026-06-17T20:06:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2749/tradergen/1.5.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib", "status": "ok"}]}, {"version": "1.6.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.13", "content_length": 214512, "downloads": 114, "published_at": "2026-06-18T03:09:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2749/tradergen/1.6.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib", "status": "ok"}]}, {"version": "1.7.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.13", "content_length": 226314, "downloads": 212, "published_at": "2026-06-19T00:48:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2749/tradergen/1.7.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib", "status": "ok"}]}, {"version": "1.8.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.13", "content_length": 235587, "downloads": 86, "published_at": "2026-06-24T14:47:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2749/tradergen/1.8.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib", "status